  "description": "Aspose.ZIP for .NET is a flexible and easy to use .NET API that lets you compress and extract, encrypt and decrypt files in almost all mainstream archive formats. It supports zip, gzip, bzip2, tar, cpio, lzip, 7z, lzma, xz and Z format. It allows you to create self-extracting archives and extract RAR, cab, lha, arj, wim formats as well.",
